## Notes: ZacUI class HUDs for every class, and the Drink Ticker. Native ports of the class-pack WeakAuras.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 2.0.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
